{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.delivery",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "事务所门口放着个大纸箱",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.delivery",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mikoto.delivery",
    "idolId": "mikoto",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──咦，美琴来了啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天也有课吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "啊……うん。不过今天是一个小时之后。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。事务所这边有事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………总觉得你有点静不下来。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──与其说有事……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………！好像来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么啊，点了外卖……？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！？那是什么纸箱。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "这个……会自己打扫的，新吸尘器。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，看箱子大概能明白……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，它为什么寄到这儿来了？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "因为前阵子，你说网购的东西可以寄到事务所吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "所以我想把坏掉的家电换掉……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……难道说，在事务所收，还是不行？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，确实我说了可以在事务所收，没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只是想说，美琴自己能收的话，寄到家里不就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "啊…………",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话说，那个挺大挺重的吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "从这里拿回去，相当费劲吧……没事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……………………",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………美琴？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──其实。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "之后，电视的显示器也要送来……寄到这里。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……！那，难道洗衣机也是……你不会要说吧！？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "那、那个还没……还没按下订单按钮，所以算安全？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……安全吗……这样啊，太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────好。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "首先，这台吸尘器和之后要来的显示器，装到车上去。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天回去的时候，一边送美琴一边搬。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……！可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。还有洗衣机……在家里收才比较麻烦。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……日程我来调，让美琴能好好收到。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "同时工作也能好好做、课也能好好上。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "谢谢，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，这种事算不算制作人的工作……虽然可能不算。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，能帮上美琴真是太好了！",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "………………啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……美琴？",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "────呼……啊哈哈。对不起，总觉得有点好笑。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我自己的冒失也是……连这种事都替我做，也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "うん。果然 283 制作……",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……不，也许是制作人比较特别。"
      }
    }
  },
